    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this parody of popular streamers! Play as your favorite content creators like Mokipane, Asmondsilver and CQX. Form a cult! Squeeze your pay piggies, start drama, appease chat and rake in the dough. Earn bitties by performing actions for chat, collect the fallen bits using various stream upgrades that multiply their values. Use the money earned to buy upgrades for stream, random temporary upgrades that boosts every drop of money from your following, Buy different streamers and play minigames! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What can you expect from this game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Over 5 iconic parodies of popular streamers and celebrities, each with their own sound clips and actions.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Multiple upgrades that help boost income.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Achievements.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skill Tree</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Prestige </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Radio feature with copyright free Lo-Fi beats.</i></p></li></ul>",
